  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Belize Compact - Education Project: The Education Project aims to invest in Belize&#xFFFD;s secondary education and technical and vocational education training (TVET) sector. The project will finance:
a) establishing an educational quality assurance system to assess and improve the quality of management and teaching as well as the achievement of learning outcomes,
b) building capacity of educational leadership and teachers,
c) providing teaching and learning resources,
d) supporting the increase in the percentage of primary graduates that enroll in and complete secondary school, and
e) supporting the establishment of a National Training Agency and building the capacity of the TVET sector to implement inclusive TVET programs that are aligned to labor market needs.</narrative>
  </description>
